Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.10,0:00:15.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,北边  西边  南边  汇报\N{\rEng}North, West, South, report.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.06,0:00:22.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你那话是什么意思\N{\rEng}What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.54,0:00:24.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是我说的意思\N{\rEng}What I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.08,0:00:29.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你希望他能活下去\N{\rEng}You hope the guy makes it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.19,0:00:32.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不够\N{\rEng}That's not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.07,0:00:35.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-如果你他妈在乎...  -卡尔\N{\rEng}- If you give a shit -- ‭- Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.68,0:00:39.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你在乎  就做点什么\N{\rEng}If you care, you do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.99,0:00:42.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要只是希望\N{\rEng}You don't just hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.01,0:00:44.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仅仅希望是不够的\N{\rEng}It takes more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.66,0:00:46.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就这意思\N{\rEng}That's what I meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.61,0:00:54.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,战斗过后会有收获\N{\rEng}There's gonna be something after the fight's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.37,0:00:56.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是每个人都有\N{\rEng}Not for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.62,0:00:58.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  但是\N{\rEng}Okay, yeah, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.27,0:01:01.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的收获是什么\N{\rEng}What about for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.30,0:01:28.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟照片上不同\N{\rEng}Different from picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.44,0:01:34.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,简迪斯\N{\rEng}Jadis!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.18,0:01:36.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,子弹来自窗户\N{\rEng}It's coming from the window!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.24,0:01:40.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们反击  然后撤退\N{\rEng}We hit it and fall... back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.15,0:01:56.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走\N{\rEng}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.78,0:01:59.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们逃出来了\N{\rEng}They got out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.06,0:02:01.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没过多久  我们得警告大家\N{\rEng}It hasn't been long. We have to warn everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.75,0:02:02.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们会反击的\N{\rEng}They're gonna hit back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.56,0:02:04.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以在东边哨点附近弄到车  然后分头走\N{\rEng}We can get the cars near the East lookout and split up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.91,0:02:06.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许得找别的车\N{\rEng}Might have to find other rides.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.54,0:02:08.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狙击手可能开车逃走了\N{\rEng}The snipers probably used theirs to get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.48,0:02:10.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想他们没逃走\N{\rEng}I don't think they got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.07,0:02:15.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会活下去的  爸爸\N{\rEng}You're gonna live, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.83,0:02:20.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们为什么要这样做\N{\rEng}Why are we doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.25,0:02:22.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么要反抗他们\N{\rEng}Why are we fighting them?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.78,0:02:25.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不就是为了不让他们如愿吗\N{\rEng}So it isn't like how they want it,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.26,0:02:27.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不让大家为他们工作\N{\rEng}with everyone working for them,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.39,0:02:28.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不让大家为他们活着\N{\rEng}everyone living for them?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.09,0:02:34.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们反抗是为了所有人一起奋斗\N{\rEng}We're fighting so it's all of us working together
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.09,0:02:37.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不仅仅是为了杀别人\N{\rEng}for something more than just killing other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.81,0:02:42.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得我们以后\N{\rEng}Well, you think ‭we're gonna be out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.42,0:02:44.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会跟尼根一起摘草莓吗\N{\rEng}picking strawberries with Negan?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.31,0:02:45.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果有必要的话\N{\rEng}If that's what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.37,0:02:47.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仅仅希望是不够的\N{\rEng}It's more than just hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.01,0:02:51.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道我们要杀光他们所有人吗\N{\rEng}What, are we just gonna kill all of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.97,0:02:58.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到前进的办法更难\N{\rEng}Finding some way forward, that's harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.15,0:03:00.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,更有意义\N{\rEng}That's something more.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.97,0:03:04.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸  必须那样\N{\rEng}Dad, ‭that's how it's got to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.77,0:04:51.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.13,0:05:07.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们一定会跟我们谈  对吧\N{\rEng}They have to talk to us, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.62,0:05:11.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毕竟我们远道而来\N{\rEng}After coming all this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.49,0:05:16.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\rEng}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.39,0:05:17.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是\N{\rEng}I was just...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.88,0:05:20.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\rEng}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.98,0:05:27.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,埃里克和我之前会像这样\N{\rEng}Eric and I used to take trips like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.70,0:05:30.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开车寻找幸存者\N{\rEng}back when we were looking for people
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.89,0:05:32.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带回亚历山大\N{\rEng}to bring to Alexandria.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.33,0:05:37.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们几天前开去了山顶寨\N{\rEng}We drove to the Hilltop just a few days ago
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.72,0:05:40.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮忙为车上装甲\N{\rEng}and...helped armor those cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.43,0:05:43.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他就在你现在坐的地方\N{\rEng}He was always right there, where you are now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.15,0:05:47.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是\N{\rEng}I was just...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.44,0:05:49.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想起了那一切\N{\rEng}remembering that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.61,0:05:50.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很遗憾\N{\rEng}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.81,0:05:54.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得确保他的死有意义\N{\rEng}I need to make sure he died for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.88,0:06:00.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你刚在说什么\N{\rEng}Tell me what you were saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.98,0:06:02.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在说\N{\rEng}I was, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.68,0:06:04.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在想海边旅馆\N{\rEng}I was just thinking about Oceanside.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.88,0:06:07.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想知道她们会不会跟我们谈\N{\rEng}Wondering if they'll talk to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.96,0:06:09.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望她们会\N{\rEng}I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.80,0:06:11.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们尽量别惊动她们\N{\rEng}We got to try not to scare them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.34,0:06:13.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,塔拉说过  在遇见她之前\N{\rEng}Tara said that, up until her,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.48,0:06:15.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她们都是见人就杀的\N{\rEng}they killed on sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.47,0:06:19.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次风险很大\N{\rEng}It's going to be a risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.02,0:06:24.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们需要她们的支持\N{\rEng}We need to have them be a part of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.46,0:06:26.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们需要说服她们\N{\rEng}We just have to convince them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.09,0:06:30.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必须说服\N{\rEng}We have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.23,0:06:34.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们应该把枪带来还给她们\N{\rEng}We should've brought guns for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.26,0:06:36.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们必须留着那些枪\N{\rEng}We have to hold on to those guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.36,0:06:39.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以把我的枪给辛蒂\N{\rEng}I could give Cyndie mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.26,0:06:42.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你必须得有枪  伊妮德\N{\rEng}You're gonna need your gun, Enid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.25,0:06:44.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\rEng}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.27,0:06:49.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真希望这一切在我用到枪之前就结束了\N{\rEng}I just want it to end before that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.55,0:06:51.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也希望\N{\rEng}I do, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.63,0:07:00.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会开车吗\N{\rEng}You know how to drive?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.33,0:07:03.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会\N{\rEng}Uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.81,0:07:05.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算会吧\N{\rEng}Well, sort of.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.46,0:07:08.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正比卡尔开得好\N{\rEng}I'm better than Carl, anyways.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.29,0:07:20.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么转向了\N{\rEng}Why are you turning?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.69,0:07:22.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们应该径直朝前的\N{\rEng}We're supposed to be going straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.88,0:07:25.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想去看一个东西\N{\rEng}Uh, I just want to check something out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.29,0:07:29.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是想给她们准备一些她们用得上的东西\N{\rEng}Maybe it's just about giving them something they can use.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.03,0:07:34.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说得对\N{\rEng}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.02,0:07:36.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不能空手去\N{\rEng}We can't show up empty-handed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.67,0:07:38.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社交礼仪\N{\rEng}Social graces. ‭
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.72,0:07:46.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord1}罗阿诺克酿酒厂\N前方2英里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.45,0:08:02.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们很快就回来\N{\rEng}We'll be back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.31,0:08:04.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会把你爸爸也带回来  好吗\N{\rEng}I'll bring your daddy, too, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.41,0:08:07.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能和我说"拜拜"吗\N{\rEng}Can you say bye-bye?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.05,0:08:09.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-拜拜  -拜\N{\rEng}- Bye-bye. -‭Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.66,0:08:24.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很高兴你回来了\N{\rEng}I'm glad you came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.64,0:08:27.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一起行动比较好\N{\rEng}It's better we go out there together.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.20,0:08:29.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,计划成功了\N{\rEng}It worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.75,0:08:31.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们冲进去  让他们投降\N{\rEng}We'll roll in, tell them to give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.43,0:08:33.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们就会投降了\N{\rEng}They're gonna give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.57,0:08:37.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\rEng}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.30,0:08:39.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没做到\N{\rEng}I couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.53,0:08:42.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用道歉\N{\rEng}Don't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.13,0:08:44.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了\N{\rEng}It worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.89,0:09:06.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord1}爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.64,0:09:43.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord1}无论如何都要活下去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.21,0:10:04.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了\N{\rEng}It worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.52,0:10:07.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们撞开了门  行尸进去了\N{\rEng}We opened it up for the walkers. They're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.36,0:10:14.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好\N{\rEng}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.28,0:10:16.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们一鼓作气做完  按计划来\N{\rEng}So we'll finish it, just like we planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.51,0:10:17.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.44,0:10:20.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你回来时去了那间仓库吗\N{\rEng}You stop by that warehouse on your way back?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.37,0:10:22.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有找到什么枪支弹药吗\N{\rEng}Find any guns, ammo?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.52,0:10:27.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没  没什么重武器\N{\rEng}No, nothing heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.19,0:10:30.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有一些闪光弹  烟雾弹...\N{\rEng}Just some stun grenades, smoke grenades...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.47,0:10:32.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有汽笛  八成是用来引行尸的\N{\rEng}air horn, probably for redirects.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.29,0:10:34.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\rEng}Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.61,0:10:36.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们投降之后\N{\rEng}Well, after they surrender,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.41,0:10:38.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以用这些东西引开尸群\N{\rEng}we should use this stuff to redirect the herd.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.51,0:10:39.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们该带上这些东西\N{\rEng}We should take it with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.57,0:10:50.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  没问题\N{\rEng}Yeah. That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.08,0:10:51.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,堆起来\N{\rEng}Yeah, stack it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.36,0:10:52.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错  继续放\N{\rEng}Yeah, keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.42,0:10:55.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\rEng}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.06,0:10:56.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个看起来很重的箱子呢\N{\rEng}What about that really heavy-looking crate?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.26,0:10:58.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,棒极了\N{\rEng}Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.83,0:11:00.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汽笛呢\N{\rEng}What about the air horn?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.56,0:11:02.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,酷  好吧\N{\rEng}Cool. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.60,0:11:03.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\rEng}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.88,0:11:06.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  我能行\N{\rEng}Yeah, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.71,0:11:32.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord1}罗阿诺克酿酒厂
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.11,0:11:43.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里可以吗\N{\rEng}This good?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.99,0:11:44.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\rEng}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.55,0:11:47.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是个不错的地方\N{\rEng}It's as good a place as any.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.59,0:11:50.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.47,0:12:49.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不该来这里\N{\rEng}You shouldn't have come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.02,0:13:00.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放下枪  马上\N{\rEng}Drop it! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.93,0:13:02.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站起来  慢点\N{\rEng}Get up. Slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.46,0:13:05.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祖母\N{\rEng}Grandma?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.90,0:13:07.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祖母\N{\rEng}Grandma!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.78,0:13:18.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\rEng}Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.89,0:13:26.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要\N{\rEng}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.52,0:13:41.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡尔\N{\rEng}Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.34,0:13:47.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直在找你\N{\rEng}I've been lookin' for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.91,0:13:50.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们准备出发了\N{\rEng}We're about ready to head out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.01,0:13:51.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\rEng}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.40,0:13:54.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在帮某人\N{\rEng}I'm helping someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.04,0:13:57.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个旅人\N{\rEng}A traveler.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.34,0:14:02.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在下水道里\N{\rEng}In the sewer?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.17,0:14:12.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们可能想知道\N{\rEng}You may be wondering
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.55,0:14:15.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么你们的哨兵没拉响警报\N{\rEng}why the hell your lookouts didn't sound the alarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.39,0:14:18.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看  我们很客气\N{\rEng}See, we are polite.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.64,0:14:21.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不知他们何时能从枪伤中醒来\N{\rEng}I mean, I don't know when they're gonna wake up from that kinda shot,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.90,0:14:23.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他们应该会"醒来"的\N{\rEng}but they should wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.99,0:14:26.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以就别拐弯抹角了\N{\rEng}So let's just cut through the cow shit...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.29,0:14:27.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们输了\N{\rEng}you lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.91,0:14:29.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都结束了\N{\rEng}It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.89,0:14:32.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在你们的小房子前面排好队\N{\rEng}So you're gonna line up in front of your little houses,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.12,0:14:33.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好想想该怎么道歉\N{\rEng}and you're gonna work up some apologies,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.92,0:14:36.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,表现最差的那个人\N{\rEng}and then the person with the lamest one
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.39,0:14:37.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会被杀\N{\rEng}is gonna get killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.74,0:14:40.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接着我会当着大家的面杀了瑞克  作为了结\N{\rEng}Then I kill Rick in front of everybody, and we move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.07,0:14:45.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们有三分钟时间打开大门\N{\rEng}You have three...count 'em, three minutes to open this gate,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.09,0:14:47.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,否则我们就把你们轰个稀巴烂\N{\rEng}or we start bombing the shit out of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.74,0:14:48.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们逃出来了\N{\rEng}They got out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.45,0:14:51.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快\N{\rEng}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.58,0:14:59.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米琼恩\N{\rEng}Michonne.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.33,0:15:01.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走\N{\rEng}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.50,0:15:46.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord1}陛下\N我不得不走了\N我们说过要去  不能说话不算话\N我希望胜利时我能在场\N我希望你也在场  兄弟\N杰瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.05,0:16:27.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得他们会投降吗\N{\rEng}Do you think they'll surrender?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.98,0:16:29.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会的\N{\rEng}They will.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.80,0:16:31.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终归会的\N{\rEng}Eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.47,0:16:34.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在不会吗\N{\rEng}Not now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.54,0:16:36.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会那么快就放弃吗\N{\rEng}Would we give up that quick?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.35,0:16:41.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会\N{\rEng}No, we wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.77,0:16:43.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那当然\N{\rEng}Damn straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.55,0:16:46.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们今天不投降  很快也会投降的\N{\rEng}They don't surrender today, they will soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.87,0:16:50.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要断粮  断水\N{\rEng}Just need to run out of food...water...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.30,0:16:53.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没了选择\N{\rEng}choices.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.80,0:17:03.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢点\N{\rEng}Slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.90,0:17:08.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\rEng}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.23,0:17:12.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以前路中间没有树\N{\rEng}Tree in the road wasn't there before.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.79,0:17:15.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是自己倒下来的\N{\rEng}Could've fallen on its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.52,0:17:16.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,树有时会这样\N{\rEng}Trees do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.09,0:17:17.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是他们\N{\rEng}It's them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.06,0:17:20.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出事了\N{\rEng}Something happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.43,0:17:34.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伯蒂  调头\N{\rEng}Bertie, turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.21,0:17:38.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伯蒂\N{\rEng}Bertie!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.99,0:17:41.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛姬\N{\rEng}Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.45,0:18:29.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\rEng}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.34,0:19:20.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们好呀\N{\rEng}Hello, hello, hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.74,0:19:28.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚夜色真美\N{\rEng}What a damn nice night.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.45,0:19:32.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得假装我们要从后面逃跑\N{\rEng}You need to make it look like we're escaping out back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.63,0:19:34.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进丛林  在去采石场的半途中\N{\rEng}Get to the woods, halfway to the quarry,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.29,0:19:35.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把灯熄灭\N{\rEng}and cut the lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.28,0:19:36.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和他们拉开距离\N{\rEng}Get enough of a lead on them,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.74,0:19:38.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,攻击他们  然后徒步逃走\N{\rEng}hit them, and get away on foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.73,0:19:39.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道我们会在哪\N{\rEng}You know where we'll be.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.53,0:19:43.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要拿上枪  把其他人带过来\N{\rEng}Just have to get the guns, get everyone else here,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.49,0:19:44.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会在那汇合\N{\rEng}and we'll meet you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.21,0:19:45.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剩两分钟了  各位\N{\rEng}Two minutes, people!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.29,0:19:47.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加把劲\N{\rEng}Dig deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.39,0:19:50.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要永生难忘的道歉\N{\rEng}I want these apologies to be memorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.38,0:19:52.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,创意还能加分\N{\rEng}Bonus points for creativity.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.80,0:19:54.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,写首诗  唱首歌\N{\rEng}Work up a poem, sing a song.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.81,0:19:56.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我他妈最爱了\N{\rEng}I love that shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.43,0:19:57.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧\N{\rEng}Get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.35,0:19:58.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,医务室里有人\N{\rEng}There's gonna people in the infirmary.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.61,0:19:59.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们需要你们的帮助\N{\rEng}They're gonna need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.77,0:20:01.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们有枪\N{\rEng}Look, we got guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.59,0:20:02.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能对抗他们\N{\rEng}We can fight them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.66,0:20:03.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以  但不是现在\N{\rEng}We will, but not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.57,0:20:04.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡尔说得对\N{\rEng}Carl's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.63,0:20:07.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡尔  这地方不能拱手让人\N{\rEng}Carl, we can't just let them have this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.10,0:20:08.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能的\N{\rEng}We can.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.30,0:20:10.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的任务是活过今晚\N{\rEng}All you need to do is survive tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.85,0:20:13.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次由我做主  你说过的\N{\rEng}This is my show. You said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.05,0:20:16.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我的计划  你得照做\N{\rEng}This is my plan, and you're gonna do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.38,0:20:17.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们都得照做\N{\rEng}You're all gonna do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.78,0:20:18.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出发吧\N{\rEng}So let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.06,0:20:20.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还剩一分钟\N{\rEng}One minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.91,0:20:22.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还剩一分钟\N{\rEng}One minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.80,0:20:48.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都来了\N{\rEng}Well, here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.53,0:20:51.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不想闹成这样\N{\rEng}I didn't want it to come to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.42,0:20:53.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我今晚宁愿待在家里\N{\rEng}Much rather would've been at home tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.64,0:20:55.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你们想点菜单上没有的菜\N{\rEng}But you folks wanted to order off the menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.83,0:20:56.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞧瞧\N{\rEng}And look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.09,0:21:00.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在你们得吃屎了\N{\rEng}Now you have to eat shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.89,0:21:04.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不想喂你们吃屎\N{\rEng}God knows I didn't want to be the one serving it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.46,0:21:15.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神之国和其子民  此刻起由尼根接管\N{\rEng}The Kingdom and everyone in it now belongs to Negan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.03,0:21:17.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从今往后\N{\rEng}Moving forward,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.29,0:21:20.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们所生产的一切都归我们\N{\rEng}everything that you produce will belong to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.32,0:21:22.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会留给你们\N{\rEng}We're going to give you
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.25,0:21:25.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,足以支撑你们干活的分量\N{\rEng}just enough to keep you working,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.51,0:21:29.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过你们应该很快就会减掉那圈婴儿肥\N{\rEng}but you're probably going to lose the freshman 15 pretty quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.36,0:21:31.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,此外\N{\rEng}In addition,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.89,0:21:34.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有身体健全的男女\N{\rEng}all able-bodied men and women
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.55,0:21:37.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都将被送往救世堂\N{\rEng}will also be transported to the Sanctuary
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.25,0:21:40.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,负责修补和重建\N{\rEng}to see to its repair and refurbishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.38,0:21:41.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有\N{\rEng}And...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.88,0:21:45.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你们把我们的家\N{\rEng}since you made our former home
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.79,0:21:48.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弄得到处是死人和行尸\N{\rEng}a goddamn mess of death and the dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.67,0:21:51.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们只好先住这了\N{\rEng}we'll be hanging our hat here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.20,0:22:09.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们都懂会发生什么\N{\rEng}You all know the drill.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.18,0:22:14.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们近来的决定改变了一切\N{\rEng}Due to your recent decisions, everything has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.29,0:22:17.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但一切又没有改变\N{\rEng}And yet, nothin' has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.23,0:22:21.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有人必须上交枪支\N{\rEng}Everyone needs to hand over their guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.66,0:22:30.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加里  有人轻举妄动就毙了那混蛋\N{\rEng}Gary, shoot that beautiful bastard if anyone tries anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.21,0:22:32.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,车里的人也一样\N{\rEng}Same goes for everyone in the cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.85,0:22:59.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\rEng}Okeydokey.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.91,0:23:02.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是你自找的  瑞克\N{\rEng}Brought this on yourself, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.07,0:23:05.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想和你们合作\N{\rEng}See, I was willing to work with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.09,0:23:10.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们只要遵守一些很简单的规则\N{\rEng}All you had to do was follow a few very simple rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.81,0:23:11.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在\N{\rEng}Now --
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.16,0:23:15.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在你们只能去死了\N{\rEng}Well, now I see that you got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.21,0:23:19.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,徒留焦土吧  混蛋们\N{\rEng}Scorched earth, you dick!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.80,0:23:21.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不在家\N{\rEng}He's not home.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.24,0:23:24.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我勒个去\N{\rEng}Oh-ho-holy shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.20,0:23:27.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有人都别开火  是卡尔\N{\rEng}Everybody hold your fire. It's Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.39,0:23:30.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看你\N{\rEng}Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.28,0:23:33.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像个大孩子一样来应门\N{\rEng}Answering the door like a big boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.16,0:23:36.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真是自豪\N{\rEng}I am so proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.95,0:23:38.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸不在家吗\N{\rEng}Daddy's not home, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.71,0:23:42.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想他回来后将看到惊喜烟花秀的\N{\rEng}Well, I guess he's gonna get back to a big old smoky surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.99,0:23:44.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里有很多家庭\N{\rEng}There's families in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.04,0:23:46.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孩子们\N{\rEng}Kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.81,0:23:48.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我妹妹\N{\rEng}My little sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.74,0:23:53.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真让老子心碎\N{\rEng}Well, that shit just breaks my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.23,0:23:56.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救世堂也有孩子们\N{\rEng}There's kids at the Sanctuary.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.08,0:23:57.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你肯定看到过他们\N{\rEng}You must've seen 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.02,0:24:01.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,某个哨站里甚至有个小宝宝\N{\rEng}Even had a little baby at one of the outposts.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.39,0:24:04.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道她怎么样了\N{\rEng}I wonder what happened to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.72,0:24:14.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么是公平的  孩子\N{\rEng}None of this shit's fair, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.17,0:24:18.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你很清楚\N{\rEng}Hell, you know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.42,0:24:21.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不得不亲手杀了你妈妈\N{\rEng}You had to kill your own mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.25,0:24:25.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太残忍了\N{\rEng}That is screwed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.23,0:24:29.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因此  我们需要有人出来做主\N{\rEng}Ergo, ‭we need someone in charge
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.26,0:24:30.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愿意不惜一切代价\N{\rEng}who's willing to do whatever it takes
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.81,0:24:33.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,确保不会再发生那种事\N{\rEng}to make sure that shit doesn't happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.03,0:24:37.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等\N{\rEng}Oh. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.56,0:24:39.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个人就是我\N{\rEng}That's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.38,0:24:40.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坏事确实会发生\N{\rEng}Bad stuff does happen,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.36,0:24:41.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我们可以想办法\N{\rEng}but we can figure this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.94,0:24:43.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能阻止这一切\N{\rEng}We can stop this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.05,0:24:44.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在你又想谈了\N{\rEng}Oh, now you want to talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.30,0:24:49.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你爸爸说不管怎样我都得死\N{\rEng}See, your dad had it that I died, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.20,0:24:52.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他给了我的手下选择\N{\rEng}He gave my people a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.11,0:24:54.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没给我\N{\rEng}Not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.40,0:24:58.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我们要达成新的共识\N{\rEng}Now we're gonna need a new understanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.04,0:25:01.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-道歉  惩罚  -杀了我\N{\rEng}- Apologies, punish-- - Kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.32,0:25:15.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\rEng}What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.60,0:25:18.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你必须杀人\N{\rEng}If you have to kill someone,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.13,0:25:21.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必须惩罚  那就杀了我\N{\rEng}if there has to be punishment, then kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.59,0:25:26.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是认真的\N{\rEng}I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.20,0:25:31.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想死吗\N{\rEng}You wanna die?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.00,0:25:35.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想\N{\rEng}No, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.34,0:25:38.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我会死\N{\rEng}But I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.09,0:25:42.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总会死的\N{\rEng}It's gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.37,0:25:47.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我的死能阻止这一切\N{\rEng}And I-- if me dying could stop this,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.59,0:25:50.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果能做出一些改变...\N{\rEng}if it can make things different --
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.30,0:25:53.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对我们  对你\N{\rEng}for us, for you, ‭
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.92,0:25:56.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对其他的那些孩子们  那就值了\N{\rEng}for all those other kids -- it'd be worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.41,0:26:02.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道原本计划是这样吗\N{\rEng}I mean, was this the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.81,0:26:06.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道应该是这样吗\N{\rEng}Was it supposed to be this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.87,0:26:10.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你原本想变成这样的人吗\N{\rEng}Is this who you wanted to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.45,0:26:38.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汽车挡不住的  小德\N{\rEng}Cars aren't gonna be enough, D.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.54,0:26:39.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们应该用卡车\N{\rEng}We should've had the trucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.99,0:26:41.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  能挡住\N{\rEng}No, it'll hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.25,0:26:44.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备好清理吧\N{\rEng}Just get ready for cleanup.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.58,0:26:53.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真该死\N{\rEng}Well, I'll be damned.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.97,0:26:55.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点  追上他们\N{\rEng}Come on! Let's get 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.11,0:26:57.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有车队逃出  我们在追\N{\rEng}Got a convoy out. We're on 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.64,0:27:15.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狗娘养的  卡尔\N{\rEng}Son of a bitch, Carl!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.02,0:27:17.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚那只是演戏吗\N{\rEng}Was that just a play?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.10,0:27:18.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还以为咱俩动真感情了\N{\rEng}I thought we were havin' a moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.39,0:27:19.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小王八羔子\N{\rEng}you little asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.77,0:27:21.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全炸了\N{\rEng}Bombs away!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.75,0:28:25.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在  最后一件事\N{\rEng}Now, there's one last piece of business.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.90,0:28:29.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这地方有一个人\N{\rEng}There's ....one person here
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.42,0:28:32.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得对发生的这一切负责\N{\rEng}who has to answer for all of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.75,0:28:35.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以西结\N{\rEng}Ezekiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.48,0:28:37.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要他\N{\rEng}I need him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.27,0:28:40.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还没找到他\N{\rEng}We haven't found him yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.01,0:28:43.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不指望有谁会把他交出来\N{\rEng}I don't expect anyone to give him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.78,0:28:45.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我想说\N{\rEng}But I will say,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.47,0:28:50.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮自己一个忙  合作一点\N{\rEng}to do yourselves a favor and cooperate now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.11,0:28:57.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在那片废墟里\N{\rEng}We didn't see any goons with dreadlocks
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.96,0:28:59.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没看见那个扎着脏辫的白痴\N{\rEng}back at what was left of the homestead,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.38,0:29:01.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以他肯定在这\N{\rEng}so he's gotta be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.38,0:29:11.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们有规矩  而他坏了规矩\N{\rEng}There are rules, and he broke them!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.35,0:29:14.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要是再不交出他\N{\rEng}And if you do not give him up right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.11,0:29:20.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一场惨剧就将上演\N{\rEng}this...moves into something traumatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.08,0:29:23.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想这样\N{\rEng}I don't want that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.62,0:29:33.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别再火上浇油了\N{\rEng}Don't make this any worse than it already is.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.93,0:29:35.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有孩子在场呢\N{\rEng}There's goddamn kids here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.87,0:29:37.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们不需要看到这些\N{\rEng}They don't need to see this shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.55,0:29:50.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那好\N{\rEng}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.55,0:29:55.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们还有五分钟\N{\rEng}You got five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.67,0:29:57.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后就按尼根的方式来\N{\rEng}Then it's Negan's way.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.34,0:30:00.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这都怪你们\N{\rEng}And that's on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.03,0:30:02.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不怪我\N{\rEng}Not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.54,0:30:08.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们怎么逃出来的\N{\rEng}How'd you get out?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.91,0:30:12.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让你猜三次\N{\rEng}Three guesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.18,0:30:18.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就当我们想到了办法吧\N{\rEng}Well, let's just say we figured it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.48,0:30:22.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-你对其他人干了什么  -没错\N{\rEng}- What'd you do to the others - ‭Oh, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.30,0:30:24.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我正要说这事呢\N{\rEng}That's exactly where I was going next.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.54,0:30:28.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在神之国正在众目睽睽之下\N{\rEng}Right now, Kingdom is getting its innards splayed out
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.23,0:30:29.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被开膛破肚\N{\rEng}for the world to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.11,0:30:34.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从今晚开始  救世军会接管那里\N{\rEng}And the Saviors will be taking possession of that property, starting tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.64,0:30:37.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚历山大也一样\N{\rEng}Same with Alexandria.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.89,0:30:40.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要他们不把事情复杂化\N{\rEng}As long as they don't make it complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.82,0:30:43.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是山顶寨呢\N{\rEng}But Hilltop?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.60,0:30:45.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些农民\N{\rEng}The farmers?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.93,0:30:49.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们新社会的产粮区\N{\rEng}The breadbasket ‭of our nascent civilization?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.46,0:30:50.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天你们走运了\N{\rEng}It's your lucky day.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.02,0:30:55.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们将继续生产粮食\N{\rEng}You've been chosen to keep producing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.05,0:31:34.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,格雷戈里让我在老大面前出了点洋相\N{\rEng}Gregory made a little bit of a fool out of me in front of the big man,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.48,0:31:39.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我希望你能够弥补过错\N{\rEng}so I am hoping that you are the one to make things right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.61,0:31:47.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听到了吗\N{\rEng}You hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.47,0:31:52.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你好好听着\N{\rEng}I need you to shift into active listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.68,0:31:57.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尤金\N{\rEng}Eugene!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.64,0:32:00.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,顺便一提\N{\rEng}Who, by the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.72,0:32:02.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之前我对他深表怀疑\N{\rEng}I was admittedly skeptical of,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.65,0:32:06.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但老天  干得漂亮\N{\rEng}but, man, worked out like gangbusters.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.44,0:32:09.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他帮我们逃出了\N{\rEng}He helped us get out of the situation
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.13,0:32:11.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冷血行尸大军的包围\N{\rEng}with the masses of the cold and impolite.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.31,0:32:15.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的手下正在引开剩下的尸群\N{\rEng}And now my guys are leading the rest of the herd away.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.18,0:32:19.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以\N{\rEng}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.34,0:32:22.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这事只会有两种结果\N{\rEng}this can go one of two ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.64,0:32:29.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一  我可以杀了跪在那边的好好先生\N{\rEng}One, ‭I can kill this likable gent on his knees over there,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.21,0:32:31.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把你从车上拖下来\N{\rEng}drag you out of this car,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.64,0:32:34.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,装进这个棺材里\N{\rEng}and put you in this box.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.95,0:32:42.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不会在里面窒息而亡\N{\rEng}In which you will not suffocate to death...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.21,0:32:44.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像你的朋友\N{\rEng}like your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.37,0:32:46.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萨沙一样\N{\rEng}Sasha.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.89,0:32:53.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后我们带你到山顶寨\N{\rEng}And then we take you to Hilltop,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.44,0:32:55.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把所有人聚起来\N{\rEng}gather everyone up,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.44,0:32:58.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在他们面前杀了你\N{\rEng}and kill you ‭in front of the whole place.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.81,0:33:02.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之后再把你运回救世堂\N{\rEng}And then drag you back to Sanctuary
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.06,0:33:04.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,插在总部前面的矛上\N{\rEng}and put on the spike in front of HQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.25,0:33:09.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接着  我的人会把尸群引到山顶寨\N{\rEng}And then my people ‭will lead the walker herd
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.10,0:33:12.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把你们没能成功剿灭我们的招数\N{\rEng}to the Hilltop and pull off the same move
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.27,0:33:16.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用在你们身上\N{\rEng}that your people tried unsuccessfully at our place.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.95,0:33:22.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这对所牵涉到的人都是一大烦心事啊\N{\rEng}What a pain in the ass for everyone concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.89,0:33:35.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者第二  你掉头  回家\N{\rEng}Or two, you turn around, go home,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.11,0:33:37.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始灌溉高粱\N{\rEng}start watering that sorghum,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.11,0:33:41.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为每个人  最重要的是  为我\N{\rEng}save everyone, ‭and, most importantly, me,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.23,0:33:42.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,省下许多麻烦\N{\rEng}a lot of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.94,0:33:46.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且  没错\N{\rEng}And, yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.42,0:33:50.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到时我们得杀死你们其中一人\N{\rEng}we're gonna have to kill one of your people.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.13,0:33:53.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但之后我们就是好伙伴了\N{\rEng}But then we're aces.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.43,0:33:59.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  加里\N{\rEng}Nah, Gary.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.15,0:34:03.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来\N{\rEng}I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.38,0:34:13.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我非常需要你明白\N{\rEng}I just really needed you
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.39,0:34:15.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在说什么\N{\rEng}to know what I was talkin' about.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.81,0:34:18.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要你闻到血味\N{\rEng}I need you to smell it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.95,0:34:21.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在告诉我  我不必杀掉\N{\rEng}Now tell me I don't got to kill
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.45,0:34:23.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这位长发飘飘的先生\N{\rEng}this gent with the lustrous mane.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.54,0:34:25.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我  我不必继续杀人\N{\rEng}Tell me I don't got to go down the line!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.88,0:34:27.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我  玛姬\N{\rEng}Tell me, Maggie!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.54,0:34:29.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-加里  -不\N{\rEng}- Gary! - ‭No!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.43,0:34:39.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你什么都不用做\N{\rEng}You don't need to do any of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.94,0:34:45.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只想请你帮个忙\N{\rEng}I just want to ask you a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.45,0:34:50.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么忙\N{\rEng}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.44,0:34:53.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想要那个棺材\N{\rEng}I'd like that box.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.41,0:34:56.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把尼尔装在里面  带回家葬了\N{\rEng}Take Neil home, to bury him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.34,0:35:05.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我答应你\N{\rEng}Favor granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.75,0:39:04.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们逃出来\N{\rEng}They didn't get out
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.45,0:39:05.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是因为我们用卡车撞了个豁口\N{\rEng}because of what we did with the truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.06,0:39:11.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算是  也只是个错误\N{\rEng}Even if they did, it was just a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.49,0:39:13.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也犯过一个错\N{\rEng}And I made one, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.87,0:39:16.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我没去救世堂杀尼根\N{\rEng}If I hadn't gone to the Sanctuary to kill Negan,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.52,0:39:18.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许萨沙还活着\N{\rEng}maybe Sasha would still be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.18,0:39:21.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许她自己就去了\N{\rEng}Maybe she would've gone herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.33,0:39:23.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许所有事最后\N{\rEng}Maybe everything would've ended up going
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.62,0:39:25.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是同样的结果\N{\rEng}exactly the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.74,0:39:27.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不希望你们这么做\N{\rEng}I didn't want you guys to do it,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.77,0:39:29.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但也许这是你们需要的\N{\rEng}but maybe you needed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.05,0:39:31.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许你们需要执行到底\N{\rEng}Maybe you needed to play things out
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.42,0:39:32.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才能想明白\N{\rEng}to figure shit out.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.71,0:39:36.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们到底在哪\N{\rEng}Where the hell are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.88,0:39:57.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停车\N{\rEng}Stop the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.76,0:39:59.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就想走近一点看\N{\rEng}I just want to take a closer look.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.16,0:40:00.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小德  快停车\N{\rEng}D, stop the damn car!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.48,0:40:02.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要把卡车引过去了\N{\rEng}You're leading the trucks right into it!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.98,0:40:04.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会害死我们的\N{\rEng}You're gonna get us killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.44,0:40:12.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就现在\N{\rEng}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.91,0:40:58.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是你不用卡车堵门的原因\N{\rEng}That's why you didn't want to block the gate with the trucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.78,0:41:00.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是你开过来的原因\N{\rEng}That's why you drove right up to this!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.06,0:41:02.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叛徒是你\N{\rEng}It was you!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.83,0:41:03.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是你做的\N{\rEng}All of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.41,0:41:07.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你快叫他们住手\N{\rEng}You tell them to stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.48,0:41:08.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管用的\N{\rEng}It doesn't work like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.55,0:41:48.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\rEng}Well, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.43,0:41:49.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以用上那些东西的\N{\rEng}We coulda used those.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.83,0:41:51.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太阳能板\N{\rEng}Solar panels?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.59,0:41:56.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,车队跑掉了是吧\N{\rEng}That convoy, they got away, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.23,0:41:57.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全跑掉了吗\N{\rEng}All of 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.32,0:42:00.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个小孩应该还在这\N{\rEng}Kid's still gotta be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.78,0:42:02.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得他想破釜沉舟\N{\rEng}I think he wanted to go down with the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.78,0:42:04.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搜查这里\N{\rEng}Search the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.95,0:42:06.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到他  把他捆起来\N{\rEng}Find him, tie him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.81,0:42:07.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别杀他\N{\rEng}Don't kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.88,0:42:10.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,炸掉剩下所有房子\N{\rEng}Blow up every other house.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.17,0:42:13.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要去瑞克家里做个意面\N{\rEng}I'm gonna go to Rick's, make a little spaghetti.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.24,0:42:16.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果他来了  送来见我\N{\rEng}When he shows up, send him my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.01,0:42:45.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趴在地上  孩子\N{\rEng}On the ground, kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.42,0:42:58.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死  走吧\N{\rEng}Dammit. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.61,0:43:32.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我勉强同意帮助你实现愿望\N{\rEng}I will acquiesce and facilitate your wishes,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.16,0:43:34.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尽管这是有勇无谋的行为\N{\rEng}regardless of the foolhardiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.17,0:43:36.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是  就我个人而言  我真诚地认为\N{\rEng}However, on a personal note, it is my sincere opinion
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.61,0:43:38.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从这间小医务室里冒险出逃\N{\rEng}that venturing from the confines of this infirmary
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.53,0:43:40.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将会是一个致命的错误\N{\rEng}will be a fatal mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.80,0:43:43.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,医生有足够的能力自行归寨\N{\rEng}The doctor is more than capable of returning on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.18,0:43:45.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而你很可能在途中死于疾病\N{\rEng}You, on the other hand, will likely succumb to illness
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.99,0:43:47.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或被撕碎\N{\rEng}or bodily rending en route.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.74,0:43:50.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我知道这是你选择的攻略\N{\rEng}But I know that that's the stratagem you're choosing,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.80,0:43:52.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而这是个肮脏的游戏\N{\rEng}and it's a dirty game.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.09,0:43:54.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们谁能告诉我\N{\rEng}Will one of you please tell me
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.10,0:43:55.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是怎么回事\N{\rEng}what the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.66,0:43:59.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加百利认为他肩负着一项上帝的使命\N{\rEng}Gabriel believes he's on a mission from God
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.58,0:44:00.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要送你回到山顶寨\N{\rEng}to return you to Hilltop
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.66,0:44:03.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为玛姬和格伦的孩子接生\N{\rEng}to tend to the birthing of Maggie and Glenn's child.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.23,0:44:07.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他哪里都去不了\N{\rEng}Look, he -- he can't go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.07,0:44:09.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是你们俩接下来需要单独讨论的事\N{\rEng}That is a conversation the two of you need to have sotto, solo.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.33,0:44:12.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是来告诉你\N{\rEng}I'm just here to inform you
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.50,0:44:15.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,北区大门的守卫已经崩坏了\N{\rEng}that the guard at the Northside gate is OOC.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.72,0:44:17.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在此情报下  你选择做与不做\N{\rEng}What you choose to do or not do with that knowledge
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.85,0:44:19.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-都与我无关  -等等\N{\rEng}- is none of my beeswax or card stacks. - Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.26,0:44:21.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你杀了一个守卫吗\N{\rEng}You killed a guard?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.43,0:44:23.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有\N{\rEng}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.06,0:44:25.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的咖啡被换掉了\N{\rEng}His coffee was compromised.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.59,0:44:28.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他现在正坐着瓷质巴士\N{\rEng}He's currently riding a porcelain bus
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.24,0:44:31.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,享受泻药和融化的无糖口香糖带来的腹泻\N{\rEng}with laxative and melted sugar-free-gum-induced diarrhea.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.63,0:44:33.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事实上  除非他健步如飞\N{\rEng}In fact, unless he was fleet of foot,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.19,0:44:34.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他现在非常有可能\N{\rEng}he may very well be
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.29,0:44:36.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经灾难性地拉在了他的卡其裤里\N{\rEng}catastrophically crapping his khakis right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.59,0:44:40.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么要这么做\N{\rEng}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.00,0:44:48.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是\N{\rEng}Just, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.57,0:44:51.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚想睡个好觉\N{\rEng}....plan on sleeping tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.89,0:44:55.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那跟我们一起走吧\N{\rEng}So come with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.97,0:44:56.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还不算太晚\N{\rEng}It's not too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.91,0:44:58.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们会原谅你的\N{\rEng}They'll take you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.82,0:45:06.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不应该那样做\N{\rEng}I shan't be doin' that.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.29,0:45:11.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕\N{\rEng}Oops.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.06,0:45:13.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好像刚掉了把车钥匙\N{\rEng}I seem to have dropped the keys to a vehicle
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.97,0:45:16.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,车就停在刚才说过的北区大门外\N{\rEng}located just outside the aforementioned Northside gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.50,0:45:20.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在做正确的事情\N{\rEng}You're doing the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.54,0:45:23.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正如之前的争论  正确与否是相对的\N{\rEng}As previously debated, that assessment is relative.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.23,0:45:24.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\rEng}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.90,0:45:26.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是的\N{\rEng}It isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.48,0:46:08.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们看我干什么\N{\rEng}What're you lookin' at me for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.58,0:46:09.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去啊\N{\rEng}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.67,0:46:33.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是以西结  我们得活捉他\N{\rEng}That's Ezekiel! We need him alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.68,0:46:35.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那该死的国王比其他人都值钱\N{\rEng}Goddamn King's worth more than all of 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.91,0:46:36.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去\N{\rEng}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.61,0:46:44.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,娜比拉  以西结在哪\N{\rEng}Nabila! Where's Ezekiel?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.28,0:46:45.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他还在里面  应该吧\N{\rEng}He's still in there -- I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.85,0:46:46.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不知道\N{\rEng}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.84,0:46:49.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得领大家去安全的地方\N{\rEng}You've got to get everyone to safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.55,0:46:51.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走库克曼大道去金斯利\N{\rEng}Take Cookman Parkway to Kingsley,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.20,0:46:52.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米色房子  两英里外\N{\rEng}beige house, 2 miles down.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.75,0:46:54.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有个栅栏  我在那里和你汇合\N{\rEng}It's got a fence. I'll meet you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.73,0:47:02.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,陛下\N{\rEng}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.93,0:47:04.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救救他们\N{\rEng}Save 'em...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.31,0:47:06.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像你当初救我一样\N{\rEng}like you saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.61,0:47:07.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等\N{\rEng}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.81,0:47:09.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以西结  不要\N{\rEng}Ezekiel, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.74,0:47:50.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛格丽特  我明白你为何把我关在这里\N{\rEng}Margaret, I -- I understand you putting me in here,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.96,0:47:53.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我懂你的意思  但是...\N{\rEng}a-a-and message received, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.48,0:47:55.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-你知道我不属于这里  -闭嘴\N{\rEng}- you know I don't belong in here. - Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.92,0:47:57.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在外面发生了什么\N{\rEng}What happened out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.90,0:48:00.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那家伙\N{\rEng}That one.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.87,0:48:02.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放出来\N{\rEng}Get him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.16,0:48:04.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他能出去吗\N{\rEng}He gets out?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.50,0:48:11.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛姬  你要干什么\N{\rEng}Maggie, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.39,0:48:13.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯尔  把枪给我\N{\rEng}Kal, I need your gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.71,0:48:30.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这家伙之前想杀你\N{\rEng}This one tried to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.44,0:48:43.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛姬  你不想这样做的\N{\rEng}Maggie, you don't wanna do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.60,0:48:45.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴  凯尔\N{\rEng}Shut up, Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.63,0:48:48.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小甜心想作秀  就让她作吧\N{\rEng}If Cupcake wants to put on a show, let her put on a show.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.28,0:48:52.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想当下一个吗\N{\rEng}You wanna be next?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.39,0:48:56.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不想\N{\rEng}No, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.01,0:49:06.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救世军今天在路上杀了我们的人\N{\rEng}Saviors killed one of our own tonight on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.81,0:49:09.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这事还没扯平  但这是个开始\N{\rEng}We aren't even, but that was a start.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.47,0:49:10.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛姬\N{\rEng}Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.80,0:49:13.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加派警卫看守周围\N{\rEng}Get more guards on duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.97,0:49:16.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加固防护墙  把尼尔埋了\N{\rEng}Start fortifying the walls and bury Neil.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.60,0:49:18.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天一亮  其他人都去打理庄稼\N{\rEng}First light, everybody else starts tending crops.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.50,0:49:19.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不是不放弃吗\N{\rEng}I thought we don't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.81,0:49:21.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错  我们不放弃\N{\rEng}No, we don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.70,0:49:23.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西蒙说其他人也被袭击了\N{\rEng}Simon said the others are under attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.72,0:49:25.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是说没有新的补给品来了\N{\rEng}which means there's no more supplies going in,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.45,0:49:26.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但可能会有人来\N{\rEng}but there might be people.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.73,0:49:28.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得做好准备\N{\rEng}We have to be ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.86,0:49:31.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,山顶寨必须当最后的堡垒\N{\rEng}Gonna be up to Hilltop to make the last stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.24,0:50:10.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结束了\N{\rEng}It's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.33,0:50:26.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我确保了你们能从后面逃出去\N{\rEng}I made sure you guys could get out the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.42,0:50:31.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把车直接开到了路障前\N{\rEng}I drove the convoy ‭right up to the roadblock.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.26,0:50:33.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道那是什么\N{\rEng}I knew what it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.28,0:50:40.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能回去了\N{\rEng}I can't go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.35,0:50:44.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有个人跑了\N{\rEng}One of 'em got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.33,0:50:45.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她会告诉他们的\N{\rEng}She's gonna tell them.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.79,0:50:49.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们是怎么逃出去的\N{\rEng}How'd they get out?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.39,0:50:51.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是因为我做的事吗\N{\rEng}Was it what I did?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.78,0:50:59.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是因为尤金\N{\rEng}Eugene.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.96,0:51:04.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还能帮你们\N{\rEng}I can still help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.01,0:51:09.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我了解他们的行事规则  知道尼根的思维方式\N{\rEng}I know how they work, how Negan thinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.00,0:51:11.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望你们赢\N{\rEng}I want you to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.40,0:51:13.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想让尼根死\N{\rEng}I want Negan to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.09,0:51:17.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其余的事之后再了结\N{\rEng}And we can settle up after.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.45,0:51:35.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得回去  立刻回去\N{\rEng}We need to get back -- now.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.51,0:52:25.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord1}我们人质多38个  别轻举妄动
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.52,0:52:29.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放在他们能看见的地方\N{\rEng}Leave it where they'll find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.22,0:52:32.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们本来合作愉快\N{\rEng}‭We had a good thing going.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.74,0:52:34.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对那孩子的事我也很难过\N{\rEng}I felt bad about the kid, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.96,0:52:38.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不希望那样  你知道的\N{\rEng}I didn't want that. You know that!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.61,0:52:44.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在要死很多很多人\N{\rEng}And now a lot more people have to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.88,0:52:48.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有时候你必须忍气吞声\N{\rEng}Sometimes you just have to swallow it!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.67,0:52:53.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是这样\N{\rEng}I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.49,0:52:57.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊  我以为你也懂的\N{\rEng}Jesus, I thought you knew that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.65,0:53:03.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜欢你  以西结\N{\rEng}I liked you, Ezekiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.61,0:53:07.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的人会在救世堂的栅栏上\N{\rEng}Your people are gonna look up at the Sanctuary fence,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.46,0:53:13.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到他们死去的国王\N{\rEng}and they're gonna see their king...is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.23,0:53:18.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续装车\N{\rEng}Keep loading the trucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.99,0:53:21.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国王大人敢做任何事  打断他的手\N{\rEng}His Highness tries anything, break his arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.42,0:53:24.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不再闹着玩了\N{\rEng}Tired of playin' bean bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.05,0:54:06.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很遗憾\N{\rEng}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.93,0:54:09.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的\N{\rEng}I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.14,0:54:21.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米琼恩\N{\rEng}Michonne.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.16,0:54:24.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米琼恩\N{\rEng}Michonne.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.02,0:54:32.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米琼恩\N{\rEng}Michonne!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.18,0:55:08.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡尔\N{\rEng}Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.74,0:55:12.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朱迪思\N{\rEng}Judith.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.86,0:55:16.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米琼恩\N{\rEng}Michonne.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.97,0:55:25.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这游戏不再好玩了\N{\rEng}This shit isn't funny anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.78,0:55:33.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别逼我现在杀你  瑞克\N{\rEng}Don't make me do this now, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.20,0:55:35.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还给你安排了计划\N{\rEng}I got plans for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.72,0:55:37.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把你一块块剁碎\N{\rEng}Cut you up in little bitty pieces,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.06,0:55:39.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂给行尸  同时逼你看着\N{\rEng}feed you to the dead, and make you watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.01,0:55:43.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后  当你变成了\N{\rEng}Then, when you're some sort of
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.28,0:55:45.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有头的扭曲人彘后\N{\rEng}screwed-up, creepy stump with a head...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.95,0:55:49.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我再杀了你\N{\rEng}...that's when I'm gonna kill you --
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.52,0:55:51.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当着所有人的面\N{\rEng}in front of everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.85,0:55:53.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-你他妈从来不闭嘴吗  -不闭\N{\rEng}- You ever shut the hell up? - ‭Nope!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.90,0:56:02.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道你儿子自愿赴死吗\N{\rEng}You know your kid volunteered to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.98,0:56:06.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是怎么教儿子的  瑞克\N{\rEng}What kind of boy you raise, Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.28,0:56:07.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会修好他的\N{\rEng}I'm gonna fix him.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.17,0:56:09.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我喜欢他\N{\rEng}'Cause I like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.34,0:56:11.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过几年\N{\rEng}A few years,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.72,0:56:13.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他就会成为我的得力手下\N{\rEng}he's gonna be one of my top guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.55,0:56:23.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等我处理完你以后\N{\rEng}When I am done with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.40,0:56:26.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永远不会有人再做你做的事\N{\rEng}nobody will ever try to do what you did --
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.12,0:56:27.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永远不会\N{\rEng}not ever again!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.78,0:56:30.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的朋友不会  你的儿子不会\N{\rEng}Not your friends, not your son --
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.65,0:56:36.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不准碰她\N{\rEng}Don't you touch her!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.45,0:56:56.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\rEng}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.41,0:57:23.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们都死了\N{\rEng}They're all dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.84,0:57:25.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你错过了  你们都错过了\N{\rEng}And you missed it -- all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.90,0:57:27.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是你的错\N{\rEng}This is your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.85,0:57:45.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米琼恩\N{\rEng}Michonne!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.55,0:57:55.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们在哪\N{\rEng}Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.70,0:58:02.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\rEng}Oh...God.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.23,1:00:27.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我带他来的\N{\rEng}I brought him here.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.61,1:00:48.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这样\N{\rEng}That's how it happened.
